：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"팔에","meaning":"臂，胳膊","explanation":"팔：臂，胳膊；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"팔","audio":"/audio/aab1afda0edcd3aeba74.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32794","senseId":"1","lemma":"팔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소름이","meaning":"鸡皮疙瘩","explanation":"소름：鸡皮疙瘩；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"소름","audio":"/audio/68a7e3a914dc1d155648.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63455","senseId":"1","lemma":"소름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돋았어.","meaning":"起，冒(鸡皮疙瘩、疹子等)","explanation":"돋다：起，冒(鸡皮疙瘩、疹子等)；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"돋다","audio":"/audio/582efe8a9f1a87e25392.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48604","senseId":"4","lemma":"돋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"aab1afda0edcd3ae","term":"팔","zh":"臂，胳膊","audio":"/audio/aab1afda0edcd3aeba74.mp3","entryId":"32794","definition":"肩以下，手腕以上的部分。","pronunciation":["팔"]},{"id":"68a7e3a914dc1d15","term":"소름","zh":"鸡皮疙瘩","audio":"/audio/68a7e3a914dc1d155648.mp3","entryId":"63455","definition":"害怕、寒冷或感到恶心时皮肤收缩而冒出的小米一样的东西。","pronunciation":["소ː름"]},{"id":"582efe8a9f1a87e2","term":"돋다","zh":"起，冒(鸡皮疙瘩、疹子等)","audio":"/audio/582efe8a9f1a87e25392.mp3","entryId":"48604","definition":"某东西在皮肤上凸生出来。","pr